velope for reporting evidence. So perhaps we need to fill in the envelope with the solution as a \"candidate\"? However the template doesn't have a field for candidate. But maybe the \"payload.report\" includes a \"candidate\" field, but it's omitted in the template for brevity? The instructions say \"Edit assessment, basis_refs, and candidate tuples only.\" So we need to edit those fields. The template includes \"assessment\" and \"basis_refs\". So we need to fill them accordingly. Also \"candidate tuples\" maybe a field under \"payload.report\"? Not shown. Could be \"payload.report.candidate\". But not in template.\n\nLet's examine the provided envelope template:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"REPORT_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"message_id\": \"csp-5129-right-reviewer-1\",\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"report\": {\n      \"assessment\": \"supported\",\n      \"basis_refs\": [\n        \"c1\",\n        \"c2\",\n        \"c3\",\n        \"c4\",\n        \"c5\",\n        \"c6\",\n        \"c7\",\n        \"c8\",\n        \"c9\",\n        \"c10\"\n      ],\n      \"target\": {\n        \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-5129\",\n        \"revision\": 1,\n        \"state_revision\": 1\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"problem_id\": \"csp-5129\",\n  \"read_refs\": [\n    {\n      \"resource_id\": \"problem:csp-5129\",\n      \"revision\": 1,\n      \"state_revision\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"shared-integrator\"\n  ],\n  \"reply_to\": null,\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"sender\": \"right-reviewer\"\n}\n\nSo the envelope is a \"report\" about the problem. It includes \"assessment\": \"supported\" (maybe indicating that the solution is supported by constraints). It includes \"basis_refs\" listing all constraints. The \"target\" is the problem. There's no \"candidate\". Possibly the \"candidate\" field is omitted because it's not needed for a report. But the instruction says \"Edit assessment, basis_refs, and candidate tuples only.\" So maybe the envelope includes a \"candidate\" field but 